    'Eight zones in rings around Demacia, from level 1 to 50, connected by roads. Monsters live in fixed spots: they wander around, chase anyone who comes close and head back home if you run. Nobody fights inside the cities; outside them, the skull turns PK on.',
  'Demacia, Piltover e Noxus com Soraka e Lojista': 'Demacia, Piltover and Noxus, each with Soraka and a Shopkeeper',
  'Viagem rápida para as cidades que você já visitou': 'Fast travel to cities you\'ve already visited',
