    'While the game is open, your champion keeps hunting even if the tab is hidden or the browser is minimized: kills, loot and the VIP automatic mode all carry on as usual. Closing the game is like logging out of an MMORPG.',
  'Funciona em outra aba ou minimizado': 'Works in another tab or minimized',
